(
    title: "Laser Gates",
    developer: Some("Dan Oliver"),
    description: Some("The Cryptic Computer that has kept the galaxies at peace has malfunctioned, and four Failsafe Detonators inside it are counting down to universal self-destruct. You spiral the Dante Dart down through the Computer\'s passages, blasting Densepack Columns, Radar Mortars, Rock Munchers and Byte Bats while timing your run through flashing, flexing and fixed forcefields. Energy drains as you fly, so touch Energy Pods to top it up, and reach each Detonator before its D-Time expires."),
